00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:32,800
is ubiquitous.

232
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:36,800
And the fact is, the distribution is ubiquitous in

233
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:40,800
nature because applied workers have discovered that everything

234
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:42,800
is normally distributed.

235
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:46,800
But applied workers think that the normal distribution is

236
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:49,800
ubiquitous in nature because mathematicians have proved that

237
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:52,800
it's ubiquitous in nature.

238
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:55,800
In fact, it's sort of ubiquitous, but it sort of

239
00:13:55,800 --> 00:13:56,800
surprises you.

240
00:13:56,800 --> 00:14:00,800
And that's one of the fundamental lessons in finance.

241
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:02,800
The fundamental lesson in finance is that you might go

242
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:05,800
into a business and you're observing some random return or

243
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:07,800
some random variable in finance.

244
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:10,800
And you kind of think you know how it behaves, and you've

245
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:12,800
