1193
01:09:20,800 --> 01:09:21,800
It's a swap.

1194
01:09:21,800 --> 01:09:24,800
But we decide in advance on what the conversion is, what the

1195
01:09:24,800 --> 01:09:28,800
swap rate is between euros and dollars.

1196
01:09:28,800 --> 01:09:32,800
And so, that's useful for risk management purposes, because

1197
01:09:32,800 --> 01:09:35,800
somebody, someone in Europe may be getting dollars revenue in

1198
