1235
01:11:53,800 --> 01:11:59,800
time, and just pay – the money just flows regularly from the

1236
01:11:59,800 --> 01:12:03,800
buyer to the seller until an event occurs, which is, say, a

1237
01:12:03,800 --> 01:12:05,800
