1241
01:12:14,800 --> 01:12:17,800
Now, you might ask, isn't this like an insurance contract?

1242
01:12:17,800 --> 01:12:19,800
Wouldn't you call this insurance?

1243
01:12:19,800 --> 01:12:27,800
If I'm paying regular payments to somebody else, and then if an

1244
