1248
01:12:38,800 --> 01:12:40,800
But it looks like insurance, right?

1249
01:12:40,800 --> 01:12:44,800
Well, actually, there's something else called credit

1250
01:12:44,800 --> 01:12:56,800
insurance, which goes back to the 19th century.

1251
01:12:56,800 --> 01:13:00,800
There were companies in, like, 1880 that would allow you to

1252
01:13:00,800 --> 01:13:05,800
