1253
01:13:05,800 --> 01:13:09,800
So, this was an institution and an invention of the 19th

1254
01:13:09,800 --> 01:13:10,800
century.

1255
01:13:10,800 --> 01:13:15,800
But credit default swaps are, what's the difference?

1256
01:13:15,800 --> 01:13:19,800
Well, the difference is that there's a whole culture and

1257
01:13:19,800 --> 01:13:23,800
regulatory environment developed around credit insurance that

1258
01:13:23,800 --> 01:13:25,800
limited it.

1259
01:13:25,800 --> 01:13:27,800
They didn't have ISDA.

1260
01:13:27,800 --> 01:13:29,800
They had state insurance regulators, okay?

1261
01:13:29,800 --> 01:13:32,800
And they just didn't have the same conceptual framework.

1262
01:13:32,800 --> 01:13:34,800
It's complicated.

1263
01:13:34,800 --> 01:13:39,800
The credit default swap was boosted by ISDA and other

1264
01:13:39,800 --> 01:13:44,800
