1268
01:13:52,800 --> 01:13:58,800
And often, the credit insurers were more like consultants.

1269
01:13:58,800 --> 01:14:02,800
They would say, we'll insure your credit against, we'll insure

1270
01:14:02,800 --> 01:14:06,800
